00:17:43,110 --> 00:17:43,980
[SPEAKER_01] pričam istinu, je l'?

99
00:17:44,430 --> 00:17:44,940
[SPEAKER_00] Da, naravno.

100
00:17:44,940 --> 00:17:46,470
